Scarlet Gallery
You do not often come this way, into the older part of the castle, which is 
narrow and has a low roof. The walls, and the ceiling too, are deep scarlet, 
the color of the old king and queen that ruled here two hundred fifty years 
ago, when there was still a kingdom.

